<title>USA: OHM Corp acquires Beneco Enterprises.</title>
<headline>OHM Corp acquires Beneco Enterprises.</headline>
<dateline>FINDLAY, Ohio 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>OHM Corp on Wednesday said it acquired Beneco Enterpises Inc, a provider of project, program and construction management services to the U.S. Department of Defense.</p>
<p>The deal was valued at $15 million at the closing. The acquisition is expected to immediately add to OHM earnings, the environmental services company said.</p>
<p>Beneco has annual revenue of more than $70 million, OHM said.</p>
<p>OHM shares rose 1/8 to 8-3/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
